Note that
\begin{align*}
\sum_{U\subseteq S}(-1)^{|U|}\binom{m-\sigma(U)}{|S|}
= [x^0]\sum_{U\subseteq S}(-1)^{|U|}\frac{(1+x)^{m-\sigma(U)}}{x^{|S|}}
&= [x^{|S|}] (1+x)^m \sum_{U\subseteq S}(-1)^{|U|}(1+x)^{-\sigma(U)} 
&= [x^{|S|}] (1+x)^m \sum_{U\subseteq S}\prod_{t\in U}\frac{-1}{(1+x)^t} 
&= [x^{|S|}] (1+x)^m \prod_{t\in S}\left(1-\frac{1}{(1+x)^t}\right) 
&= [x^{|S|}] (1+x)^{m-\sigma(S)} \prod_{t\in S}((1+x)^t-1) 
&= [x^{|S|}] (1+x)^{m-\sigma(S)} \prod_{t\in S}\sum_{k=1}^{t}\binom{t}{k}x^k 
&= [x^0] (1+x)^{m-\sigma(S)} \prod_{t\in S}\sum_{j=0}^{t-1}\binom{t}{j+1}x^j 
&= \prod_{t\in S}\binom{t}{1} = \pi(S),
\end{align*}as desired.

